%% Proposed alternative only. Mem0 is private contextual memory, not asset truth.
flowchart LR
  U[Trusted user request] --> S[Server-scoped memory search]
  M[(Mem0 private facts<br/>metadata and configured indexes)] --> S
  S --> P[Bounded prompt pack]
  P --> A[Q and A planner and composer]
  A --> G[Typed domain tools]
  G --> K[(Shared structured ledger<br/>and effective source records)]
  G --> E[Exact results and citations]
  E --> A
  A --> V[Local validation]
  V --> O[Inline answer]
  O --> RAW[(Application-owned transcript<br/>exact entity receipts)]
  RAW --> X[Selective useful-fact extraction]
  X --> M
  U --> F[Explicit correction transaction]
  F --> K
  N[Managed and OSS capabilities differ<br/>async job receipt is not committed truth] -.-> M
  N -.-> F
